hin Chebyshev distance `dist`.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/71e489b6.py:119:    \"\"\"Return the set of all coords within Chebyshev `dist` of any pixel.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/71e489b6.py:129:    \"\"\"Create an H x W grid partitioned into blue (1) and black (0) regions.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/71e489b6.py:175:    \"\"\"Return blue pixels whose 4-neighbors are all blue or out-of-bounds.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/71e489b6.py:191:    \"\"\"Place 2-9 small black defects in blue-region interiors.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/71e489b6.py:194:    \"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/71e489b6.py:267:    \"\"\"Place 0-4 leaf protrusions from large black regions into blue regions.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/71e489b6.py:307:    \"\"\"Paint orange (7) Chebyshev-1 halo around preserve pixels; keep them black.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/71e489b6.py:322:    \"\"\"Find black pixels eligible to become blue spurs (solver's STEP 0 absorbs them).\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/71e489b6.py:326:    \"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/71e489b6.py:354:    \"\"\"Single attempt to generate a valid input grid for task 71e489b6.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/71e489b6.py:402:def generate_input() -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/e3721c99.py:9:    \"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/e3721c99.py:12:    \"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/e3721c99.py:38:    \"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/e3721c99.py:43:    \"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/e3721c99.py:68:def main(grid: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/e3721c99.py:69:    \"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/e3721c99.py:83:    \"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/e3721c99.py:154:    \"\"\"Width (or height) of a single legend patch along the arrangement axis.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/